figure('03 / Five study locations · report published 2018','When landlords said no', ''.join('<div class="door-row"><div class="row-label"><span>'+name+'</span><b>'+str(v)+'%</b></div><div class="door-strip" aria-hidden="true">'+icons(v,'denied')+icons(100-v)+'</div></div>' for name,v in denials)+'<div class="legend"><span>Voucher denied</span><span class="outline">Remainder</span></div>', 'Reported voucher-denial rates in five study locations. Denominator: acceptance tests used for each location’s rate. Each row shows 100 symbols using rounded percentages.', details(['Study location','Denial rate'],[(n,f'{v}%') for n,v in denials],'The remainder does not represent completed leases. Historical findings, not current city rankings. Source: Urban Institute / HUD pilot study.')),
